<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>OG Technology — Connecter mes outils</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/hub-premium.css">
    <style>
        .shopify-token-toggle {
            display: block; width: 100%; background: none; border: none; text-align: center;
            color: #95BF47; font-size: .78rem; margin-top: 10px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .shopify-token-form { margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed #262626; }
        .shopify-guide-toggle {
            display: block; width: 100%; background: none; border: none; text-align: center;
            color: #8a8a8a; font-size: .74rem; margin-top: 8px; cursor: pointer;
        }
        .shopify-guide-toggle:hover { color: #95BF47; }

        .shopify-guide-overlay {
            position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.7); z-index: 999;
            display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px;
        }
        .shopify-guide-overlay.open { display: flex; }
        .shopify-guide-modal {
            background: #111; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 18px;
            max-width: 560px; width: 100%; max-height: 86vh; overflow-y: auto; padding: 28px;
        }
        .shopify-guide-modal h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .shopify-guide-modal p.sub { color: #888; font-size: .82rem; margin-bottom: 22px; }
        .shopify-guide-close {
            float: right; background: none; border: none; color: #666; font-size: 1.3rem; cursor: pointer;
        }
        .shopify-guide-step {
            display: flex; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
        }
        .shopify-guide-step:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
        .shopify-guide-step__num {
            flex-shrink: 0; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(149,191,71,.14); color: #95BF47; font-weight: 800; font-size: .85rem;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .shopify-guide-step__body h3 { color: #fff; font-size: .88rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .shopify-guide-step__body p { color: #999; font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.55; }
        .shopify-guide-step__path {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 8px; font-family: monospace; font-size: .72rem;
        }
        .shopify-guide-step__path span {
            background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 8px; color: #ccc;
        }
        .shopify-guide-step__path i { color: #555; width: 12px; height: 12px; }
        .shopify-guide-scopes {
            display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px;
        }
        .shopify-guide-scopes span {
            background: rgba(149,191,71,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(149,191,71,.25); color: #95BF47;
            border-radius: 20px; padding: 3px 10px; font-size: .68rem;
        }
        .shopify-guide-warn {
            margin-top: 18px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(245,166,35,.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.25); border-radius: 10px; color: #F5A623; font-size: .76rem; line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="og-capital">

    <%- include("partials/sidebar") %>

    <main class="capitol-content">

        <header class="hero-premium" style="min-height:220px;">
            <div class="hero-grid"></div>
            <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-1"></div>
            <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
            <div class="hero-text-zone">
                <span class="hero-eyebrow">OG Technology — <%= nom %></span>
                <h1>Connecter mes outils</h1>
                <p>Connectez vos plateformes. SAMII les utilisera automatiquement.</p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="connect-tools-section">

            <!-- CRÉER MA BOUTIQUE EN UN CLIC -->
            <div class="connect-create-shop-cta">
                <div class="connect-create-shop-cta__text">
                    <h2>🏪 Créer ma boutique en un clic</h2>
                    <p>Connecte ta boutique WooCommerce — SAMII branche automatiquement tes commandes, ton QG et ton suivi en temps réel.</p>
                </div>
                <a href="/connect/woocommerce" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary connect-create-shop-cta__btn">
                    Créer ma boutique →
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- MESSAGE ERREUR -->
            <div class="hub-error-msg" id="connect-error" style="display:none;"></div>

            <!-- MESSAGE SUCCÈS -->
            <div class="connect-success-msg" id="connect-success" style="display:none;"></div>

            <!-- GRILLE OUTILS -->
            <div class="connect-tools-grid" id="connect-tools-grid">

                <% tools.forEach(tool => {
                    const connector  = connecteurs.find(c => c.type === tool.id);
                    const isConnected = connector && connector.actif;
                %> 
                <div class="connect-tool-card <%= isConnected ? 'connected' : '' %> <%= !tool.available ? 'soon' : '' %>"
                     id="card-<%= tool.id %>"
                     data-tool="<%= tool.id %>"
                     data-available="<%= tool.available %>"
                     style="--tool-color:<%= tool.color %>">

                    <div class="connect-tool-card__header">
                        <div class="connect-tool-card__icon">
                            <i data-lucide="<%= tool.icon %>"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="connect-tool-card__info">
                            <h3><%= tool.label %></h3>
                            <span class="connect-tool-card__status">
                                <% if (isConnected && tool.mode === 'impression') { %>
                                    <span class="og-badge og-badge--soon">🟡 Connecté · bientôt synchronisé</span>
                                <% } else if (isConnected) { %>
                                    <span class="og-badge og-badge--live">✅ Connecté</span>
                                <% } else if (!tool.available) { %>
                                    <span class="og-badge og-badge--soon">⏳ Bientôt</span>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <span class="og-badge og-badge--off">🔴 Non connecté</span>
                                <% } %>
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="connect-tool-card__body">

                        <% if (!tool.available) { %>
                            <p class="connect-tool-card__soon-text">Disponible prochainement</p>

                        <% } else if (tool.id === 'shopify') { %>
                            <% if (isConnected) { %>
                                <p class="connect-tool-card__connected-info">
                                    🟢 <%= connector.config?.shop || 'Boutique connectée' %>
                                </p>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--disconnect"
                                        data-tool="shopify" data-action="disconnect">
                                    Déconnecter
                                </button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <form class="connect-inline-form" data-tool="shopify" data-action="oauth">
                                    <input type="text" name="shop"
                                           placeholder="monshop.myshopify.com"
                                           class="connect-input" autocomplete="off">
                                    <button type="submit" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary">
                                        Connecter Shopify →
                                    </button>
                                </form>
                                <button type="button" class="shopify-token-toggle" id="shopify-token-toggle">
                                    Pas de bouton d'installation chez toi ? Connecte-toi avec un token →
                                </button>
                                <form class="connect-inline-form shopify-token-form" id="shopify-token-form" data-tool="shopify" data-action="shopify-token" style="display:none;">
                                    <input type="text" name="shop" placeholder="monshop.myshopify.com" class="connect-input" autocomplete="off">
                                    <input type="text" name="token" placeholder="shpat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx" class="connect-input" autocomplete="off">
                                    <button type="submit" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary">Connecter avec le token →</button>
                                    <button type="button" class="shopify-guide-toggle" id="shopify-guide-toggle">📖 Comment obtenir mon token ?</button>
                                </form>
                            <% } %>

                        <% } else if (tool.id === 'facebook' || tool.id === 'instagram') { %>
                            <% if (isConnected) { %>
                                <p class="connect-tool-card__connected-info">
                                    🟢 <%= connector.config?.name || 'Page connectée' %>
                                </p>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--disconnect"
                                        data-tool="<%= tool.id %>" data-action="disconnect">
                                    Déconnecter
                                </button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary"
                                        data-tool="<%= tool.id %>" data-action="oauth"
                                        data-url="/connect/<%= tool.id %>">
                                    Continuer avec <%= tool.label %> →
                                </button>
                            <% } %>

                        <% } else if (tool.id === 'telegram') { %>
                            <% if (isConnected) { %>
                                <p class="connect-tool-card__connected-info">
                                    🟢 Chat ID : <%= connector.config?.chatId || '' %>
                                </p>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--disconnect"
                                        data-tool="telegram" data-action="disconnect">
                                    Déconnecter
                                </button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <form class="connect-inline-form" data-tool="telegram" data-action="save">
                                    <input type="text" name="chatId"
                                           placeholder="Votre Chat ID Telegram"
                                           class="connect-input" autocomplete="off">
                                    <button type="submit" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary">
                                        Connecter Telegram →
                                    </button>
                                </form>
                            <% } %>

                        <% } else if (tool.id === 'woocommerce') { %>
                            <% if (isConnected) { %>
                                <p class="connect-tool-card__connected-info">
                                    🟢 <%= connector.config?.siteUrl || 'Boutique connectée' %>
                                </p>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--disconnect"
                                        data-tool="woocommerce" data-action="disconnect">
                                    Déconnecter
                                </button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <a href="/connect/woocommerce" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">
                                    Connecter WooCommerce →
                                </a>
                            <% } %>

                        <% } else if (tool.id === 'ccp') { %>
                            <% if (isConnected) { %>
                                <p class="connect-tool-card__connected-info">
                                    🟢 <%= connector.config?.numero || 'Compte enregistré' %>
                                </p>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--disconnect"
                                        data-tool="ccp" data-action="disconnect">
                                    Déconnecter
                                </button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <a href="/connect/ccp" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">
                                    Connecter CCP →
                                </a>
                            <% } %>

                        <% } else if (tool.id === 'discord') { %>
                            <% if (isConnected) { %>
                                <p class="connect-tool-card__connected-info">
                                    🟢 <%= connector.config?.serverName || 'Bot connecté' %>
                                </p>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--disconnect"
                                        data-tool="discord" data-action="disconnect">
                                    Déconnecter
                                </button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <a href="/connect/discord" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">
                                    Connecter Discord →
                                </a>
                            <% } %>

                        <% } else if (tool.mode === 'transporteur') { %>
                            <% if (isConnected) { %>
                                <p class="connect-tool-card__connected-info">
                                    🟢 Clé perso active
                                </p>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--disconnect"
                                        data-tool="<%= tool.id %>" data-action="disconnect">
                                    Déconnecter
                                </button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <a href="/connect/<%= tool.id %>" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">
                                    Connecter <%= tool.label %> →
                                </a>
                            <% } %>

                        <% } else if (tool.mode === 'impression') { %>
                            <% if (isConnected) { %>
                                <p class="connect-tool-card__connected-info">
                                    🟡 <%= connector.config?.identifiant || 'Connecté' %>
                                </p>
                                <button class="connect-btn connect-btn--disconnect"
                                        data-tool="<%= tool.id %>" data-action="disconnect">
                                    Déconnecter
                                </button>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <a href="/connect/<%= tool.id %>" class="connect-btn connect-btn--primary" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">
                                    Connecter <%= tool.label %> →
                                </a>
                            <% } %>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>       
                </div>
                <% }) %>

            </div>

            <!-- CONTINUER VERS QG -->
            <div class="connect-tools-footer">
                <p class="connect-tools-footer__hint">
                    Vous pourrez connecter d'autres outils depuis votre QG à tout moment.
                </p>
                <a href="/connect/tools/continue?from=<%= from %>" class="connect-btn connect-btn--cta">
    <% if (from === 'samii') { %>← Retour à SAMII
    <% } else if (from === 'hub') { %>← Retour au Hub
    <% } else { %>Continuer vers mon QG →
    <% } %>
</a>
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

</div>

<!-- GUIDE : OBTENIR SON TOKEN SHOPIFY -->
<div class="shopify-guide-overlay" id="shopify-guide-overlay">
    <div class="shopify-guide-modal">
        <button type="button" class="shopify-guide-close" id="shopify-guide-close">✕</button>
        <h2>🛍️ Obtenir ton token Shopify</h2>
        <p class="sub">5 minutes, directement depuis l'admin de ta boutique — aucune validation externe requise.</p>

        <div class="shopify-guide-step">
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__num">1</div>
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__body">
                <h3>Ouvre les réglages de ta boutique</h3>
                <p>Connecte-toi sur ton admin Shopify, puis va dans :</p>
                <div class="shopify-guide-step__path">
                    <span>Paramètres</span><i data-lucide="chevron-right"></i>
                    <span>Apps et canaux de vente</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="shopify-guide-step">
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__num">2</div>
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__body">
                <h3>Développe une app</h3>
                <p>En haut à droite, clique sur <b>« Développer des apps »</b>, puis <b>« Créer une app »</b>. Donne-lui un nom, par exemple « SAMII OS ».</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="shopify-guide-step">
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__num">3</div>
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__body">
                <h3>Configure les permissions</h3>
                <p>Dans l'onglet <b>« Configuration »</b>, clique sur <b>« Configurer »</b> sous « Admin API integration », puis coche ces permissions (lecture + écriture) :</p>
                <div class="shopify-guide-scopes">
                    <span>Produits</span><span>Commandes</span><span>Clients</span>
                    <span>Inventaire</span><span>Expédition</span><span>Exécution des commandes</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="shopify-guide-step">
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__num">4</div>
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__body">
                <h3>Installe l'app</h3>
                <p>Sauvegarde, va dans l'onglet <b>« Identifiants API »</b>, puis clique sur <b>« Installer l'app »</b> en haut à droite (confirme l'installation).</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="shopify-guide-step">
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__num">5</div>
            <div class="shopify-guide-step__body">
                <h3>Copie ton token</h3>
                <p>Toujours dans « Identifiants API », sous <b>« Admin API access token »</b>, clique sur <b>« Révéler le token une fois »</b> et copie-le immédiatement — Shopify ne le réaffichera plus jamais.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="shopify-guide-warn">
            ⚠️ Ce token donne accès à ta boutique — ne le partage qu'avec SAMII, et si tu le perds, réinstalle l'app pour en générer un nouveau.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    window.OG_WORKSPACE_ID = "<%= workspaceId %>";
</script>
<script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
<script src="/js/connect-tools.js?v=2"></script>

</body>
</html>
